avbar] grid-cols-[1fr_auto] gap-x-4 max-w-[75rem] mx-auto\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 sm:hidden\"><!--[!--><!--]--> <h1 class=\"line-clamp-1 sm:hidden\">Book tickets</h1></div> <ul class=\"row-start-2 col-span-2 flex items-center gap-2 sm:flex sm:row-start-1 sm:col-span-1 sm:gap-8\"><li class=\"-mx-1 sm:-mx-4\"><a href=\"#main-content\" class=\"sr-only focus:not-sr-only\">Skip to content</a></li> <!--[--><li><a class=\"nav-item flex items-center h-10 px-3 rounded text-primary-darker hover:text-primary-dark whitespace-nowrap sm:h-8 sm:px-0 sm:rounded-none sm:!bg-transparent sm:!text-on-surface sm:border-y sm:border-transparent sm:hover:!text-primary dark:bg-primary-darkest dark:!text-on-primary-darkest sm:border-b-current svelte-w8mlhc\" href=\"/2wopiy2m/experiences\" aria-current=\"page\"><span class=\"first-letter:uppercase\"><span class=\"hidden sm:inline\">Book tickets</span> <span class=\"sm:hidden\">tickets</span></span></a></li><li><a class=\"nav-item flex items-center h-10 px-3 rounded text-primary-darker hover:text-primary-dark whitespace-nowrap sm:h-8 sm:px-0 sm:rounded-none sm:!bg-transparent sm:!text-on-surface sm:border-y sm:border-transparent sm:hover:!text-primary svelte-w8mlhc\" href=\"/2wopiy2m/vouchers\"><span class=\"first-letter:uppercase\"><span class=\"hidden sm:inline\">Gift cards</span> <span class=\"sm:hidden\">Gift cards</span></span></a></li><!--]--></ul> <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><!--[!--><!--]--> <a class=\"flex items-center gap-1 h-full font-semibold aria-disabled:pointer-events-none hover:text-primary-darkest dark:hover:text-primary-lightest\" href=\"#\" aria-disabled=\"true\">£0.00 <div class=\"relative\"><i><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"o-beyonk-svg-icon o-beyonk-svg-icon-shopping-cart\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M4.142 4 6.01 16.136q.021.15.083.284a1 1 0 0 0 .924.58H18a1 1 0 0 0 .958-.713l3-10A1 1 0 0 0 21 5H6.32l-.33-2.138a1 1 0 0 0-.346-.627A1 1 0 0 0 4.984 2H3a1 1 0 1 0 0 2zm3.716 11-1.23-8h13.028l-2.4 8zM10 20a2 2 0 1 1-4 0 2 2 0 0 1 4 0M17 22a2 2 0 1 0 0-4 2 2 0 0 0 0 4\"></path></svg><!----></i> <!--[!--><!--]--></div></a></div></div></div></nav><!----> <div class=\"space-y-8 sm:space-y-16 sm:pt-[--h-navbar] pt-[calc(var(--h-navbar)*2)]\"><main id=\"main-content\"><!----><!--[--><!----><div class=\"mt-6 px-4 sm:mt-10 md:px-6\"><div class=\"max-w-[75rem] mx-auto\"><!----><!--[!--><!----><div class=\"space-y-6\"><!--[!--><!--]--> <div class=\"max-w-[75rem] mx-auto\"><!--[--><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-x-4 gap-y-5 sm:grid-cols-2 sm:gap-4 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-4\"><!--[--><a class=\"card group overflow-hidden flex flex-col rounded-lg shadow-lg data-[type=group]:bg-primary data-[type=group]:text-on-primary svelte-1wxvc26\" href=\"/2wopiy2m/experiences/dq2c4q4a?group=experiences\" data-type=\"experience\"><div class=\"media relative overflow-hidden aspect-4/3\"><!--[!--><img class=\"w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:opacity-85 svelte-1wxvc26\" src=\"https://bcdn.beyonk.com/experiences/image_6vj3xhadxz02d6120xpp3e01433oa6n4.jpg?width=650&amp;format=jpeg\" alt=\"The Lady of Well Walk - (Every Thursday July &amp; August) For curious minds from 12 to 112 years\"/><!--]--> <!--[!--><!--]--></div> <hr class=\"border-transparent svelte-1wxvc26\"/> <div class=\"flex-1 flex flex-col min-h-20 space-y-1.5 p-4 sm:min-h-32\"><h2 class=\"line-clamp-2 leading-tight font-semibold\">The Lady of Well Walk - (Every Thursday July &amp; August) For curious minds from 12 to 112 years</h2> <div class=\"flex-1 flex gap-3\"><div class=\"overflow-hidden flex-1 flex flex-col justify-between gap-2 text-sm\"><!--[--><p style=\"--lines: 3;\" class=\"pointer-events-none leading-relaxed line-clamp-[var(--lines)]\">23rd July - 27th August 2026   An Afternoon with the Lady of Well Walk   Step quietly into the Victorian salon of the Lady of Well Walk, where the ghost of a celebrated actress still receives her guests.Through an intimate and immersive reading of works by Hampstead's great writers, she invites you on a journey into another age, followed by an elegant Afternoon Tea at our Parisian Café.         The immersive reading runs for 35 minutes. Guests who have also booked Afternoon Tea will then be served at our café for a further 60 minutes.         To view August dates, click the top-right arrow in the calendar after \"Choose Availability\".     Afternoon Tea Menu     *Please note Champagne is not included. You can upgrade to a glass of Champagne from £17.00 at the venue, just speak to a member of our team.        SALÉ     Cucumber &amp; tuna sandwich      Rillettes &amp; cornichon sandwich      Ham &amp; Comté cheese sandwich      Vegetarian quiches   SUCRÉ     Fruit tartelettes      Chocolate fondant     Crème brûlée      Macaron     Traditional scones with clotted cream &amp; jam                    For any allergies or dietary requirements, please email hello@thewellwalktheatre.com before booking. Afternoon Tea price includes a 12.5% service charge.     Children under 18 months are welcome to join without a ticket. However, due to capacity limitations, they may need to sit on a parent or carer's lap.     A ticket-carrying adult must accompany all children under 15 throughout the performance, with a minimum ratio of 1 adult per 6 children.</p><!--]--> <!--[!--><!--]--></div> <div class=\"overflow-hidden self-end size-10 rounded-full bg-surface\"><button class=\"btn w-full h-full bg-primary/20 text-primary-darker dark:text-primary-lighter\"><i><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"o-beyonk-svg-icon o-beyonk-svg-icon-arrow-right\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M12.293 5.293a1 1 0 0 1 1.414 0l6 6a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.414l-6 6a1 1 0 0 1-1.414-1.414L16.586 13H5a1 1 0 1 1 0-2h11.586l-4.293-4.293a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.414\"></path></svg><!----></i></button></div></div></div></a><a class=\"card group overflow-hidden flex flex-col rounded-lg shadow-lg data-[type=group]:bg-primary data-[type=group]:text-on-primary svelte-1wxvc26\" href=\"/2wopiy2m/experiences/3z5kd5yx?group=experiences\" data-type=\"experience\"><div class=\"media relative overflow-hidden aspect-4/3\"><!--[!--><img class=\"w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:opacity-85 svelte-1wxvc26\" src=\"https://bcdn.beyonk.com/experiences/image_hxjz2pu9wef1cv9i6krdi2mxekl3owgl.jpg?width=650&amp;format=jpeg\" alt=\"The Playhouse Buster Keaton Cineclub [Duration 23mins] For curious minds from 6 to 116 years\"/><!--]--> <!--[!--><!--]--></div> <hr class=\"border-transparent svelte-1wxvc26\"/> <div class=\"flex-1 flex flex-col min-h-20 space-y-1.5 p-4 sm:min-h-32\"><h2 class=\"line-clamp-2 leading-tight font-semibold\">The Playhouse Buster Keaton Cineclub [Duration 23mins] For curious minds from 6 to 116 years</h2> <div class=\"flex-1 flex gap-3\"><div class=\"overflow-hidden flex-1 flex flex-col justify-between gap-2 text-sm\"><!--[--><p style=\"--lines: 3;\" class=\"pointer-events-none leading-relaxed line-clamp-[var(--lines)]\">22nd - 30th August 2026         This summer, step inside The Well Walk Theatre to enjoy the early films that shaped the history of cinema.     Step into the mind-bending world of the legendary Buster Keaton in his 1921 masterpiece,  The Playhouse . Before green screens and digital effects, Buster Keaton pushed the absolute limits of optical film trickery to do the impossible: portraying more than twenty characters  at the exact same time . Don’t miss this breathtaking, hilarious tribute to the golden age of physical comedy. It’s a wild, nostalgic ride that proves classic film effects really  were  special.     Film Duration: 23mins           Recommended age: 6yrs to 116yrs    Children under 18 months are welcome to join without a ticket. However, due to capacity limitations, they may need to sit on a parent or carer's lap.        A ticket-carrying adult must accompany all children under 15 throughout the performance, with a minimum ratio of 1 adult per 6 children.</p><!--]--> <!--[!--><!--]--></div> <div class=\"overflow-hidden self-end size-10 rounded-full bg-surface\"><button class=\"btn w-full h-full bg-primary/20 text-primary-darker dark:text-primary-lighter\"><i><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"o-beyonk-svg-icon o-beyonk-svg-icon-arrow-right\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M12.293 5.293a1 1 0 0 1 1.414 0l6 6a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.414l-6 6a1 1 0 0 1-1.414-1.414L16.586 13H5a1 1 0 1 1 0-2h11.586l-4.293-4.293a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.414\"></path></svg><!----></i></button></div></div></div></a><a class=\"card group overflow-hidden flex flex-col rounded-lg shadow-lg data-[type=group]:bg-primary data-[type=group]:text-on-primary svelte-1wxvc26\" href=\"/2wopiy2m/experiences/groups/xlbf\" data-type=\"group\"><div class=\"media relative overflow-hidden aspect-4/3\"><!--[!--><img class=\"w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:opacity-85 svelte-1wxvc26\" src=\"https://bcdn.beyonk.com/experience-groups/image_smiacc9pvcla3s4mx7fxffhd07pxd1f7.jpeg?width=650&amp;format=jpeg\" alt=\"Children's Readings\"/><!--]--> <!--[!--><!--]--></div> <hr class=\"border-transparent svelte-1wxvc26\"/> <div class=\"flex-1 flex flex-col min-h-20 space-y-1.5 p-4 sm:min-h-32\"><h2 class=\"line-clamp-2 leading-tight font-semibold\">Children's Readings</h2> <div class=\"flex-1 flex gap-3\"><div class=\"overflow-hidden flex-1 flex flex-col justify-between gap-2 text-sm\"><!--[--><p style=\"--lines: 3;\" class=\"pointer-events-none leading-relaxed line-clamp-[var(--lines)]\">2 experiences</p><!--]--> <!--[!--><!--]--></div> <div class=\"overflow-hidden self-end size-10 rounded-full bg-surface\"><button class=\"btn w-full h-full bg-primary/20 text-primary-darker dark:text-primary-lighter\"><i><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"o-beyonk-svg-icon o-beyonk-svg-icon-arrow-right\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M12.293 5.293a1 1 0 0 1 1.414 0l6 6a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.414l-6 6a1 1 0 0 1-1.414-1.414L16.586 13H5a1 1 0 1 1 0-2h11.586l-4.293-4.293a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.414\"></path></svg><!----></i></button></div></div></div></a><a class=\"card group overflow-hidden flex flex-col rounded-lg shadow-lg data-[type=group]:bg-primary data-[type=group]:text-on-primary svelte-1wxvc26\" href=\"/2wopiy2m/experiences/gpwcwrz8?group=experiences\" data-type=\"experience\"><div class=\"media relative overflow-hidden aspect-4/3\"><!--[!--><img class=\"w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:opacity-85 svelte-1wxvc26\" src=\"https://bcdn.beyonk.com/experiences/image_ykwfqvu8sjr1lo0im01k1njaxzpikxtc.jpg?width=650&amp;format=jpeg\" alt=\"Petit Pierre From Transylvania (Ages 3 to 103) November\"/><!--]--> <!--[!--><!--]--></div> <hr class=\"border-transparent svelte-1wxvc26\"/> <div class=\"flex-1 flex flex-col min-h-20 space-y-1.5 p-4 sm:min-h-32\"><h2 class=\"line-clamp-2 leading-tight font-semibold\">Petit Pierre From Transylvania (Ages 3 to 103) November</h2> <div class=\"flex-1 flex gap-3\"><div class=\"overflow-hidden flex-1 flex flex-col justify-between gap-2 text-sm\"><!--[--><p style=\"--lines: 3;\" class=\"pointer-events-none leading-relaxed line-clamp-[var(--lines)]\">Saturday 10th - Sunday 1st November  11am,  3pm    Join Petit Pierre and his loyal sidekick Gedeon on a thrilling journey to the misty mountains of Transylvania! When a mysterious customer places an unusual order, the duo embarks on an adventure packed with surprising twists, spooky encounters, and plenty of laughs. This delightful puppet show for all ages will add a touch of magic and fun to your Halloween season.     Children under 18month can come without a ticket but might have to sit on their parent or carer's lap.      Children under 15 have to be accompanied by an adult throughout the performance.</p><!--]--> <!--[!--><!--]--></div> <div class=\"overflow-hidden self-end size-10 rounded-full bg-surface\"><button class=\"btn w-full h-full bg-primary/20 text-primary-darker dark:text-primary-lighter\"><i><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"o-beyonk-svg-icon o-beyonk-svg-icon-arrow-right\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M12.293 5.293a1 1 0 0 1 1.414 0l6 6a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.414l-6 6a1 1 0 0 1-1.414-1.414L16.586 13H5a1 1 0 1 1 0-2h11.586l-4.293-4.293a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.414\"></path></svg><!----></i></button></div></div></div></a><a class=\"card group overflow-hidden flex flex-col rounded-lg shadow-lg data-[type=group]:bg-primary data-[type=group]:text-on-primary svelte-1wxvc26\" href=\"/2wopiy2m/experiences/ob5fifhm?group=experiences\" data-type=\"experience\"><div class=\"media relative overflow-hidden aspect-4/3\"><!--[!--><img class=\"w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:opacity-85 svelte-1wxvc26\" src=\"https://bcdn.beyonk.com/experiences/image_b4eegxkb4uky5r0u0kly0rqu79d3o97u.jpg?width=650&amp;format=jpeg\" alt=\"Crafternoon\"/><!--]--> <!--[!--><!--]--></div> <hr class=\"border-transparent svelte-1wxvc26\"/> <div class=\"flex-1 flex flex-col min-h-20 space-y-1.5 p-4 sm:min-h-32\"><h2 class=\"line-clamp-2 leading-tight font-semibold\">Crafternoon</h2> <div class=\"flex-1 flex gap-3\"><div class=\"overflow-hidden flex-1 flex flex-col justify-between gap-2 text-sm\"><!--[--><p style=\"--lines: 3;\" class=\"pointer-events-none leading-relaxed line-clamp-[var(--lines)]\">Every Friday     3.30 pm to 4.30pm       Our Much loved Crafternoon's return! We have moved this special free event to Fridays, so why don't you come down and learn how to create some wonders!     After school, the theatre’s bookshop will transform into a creative space where one of our team members will lead mystery craft activities. Meanwhile, parents are warmly invited to relax with a hot or cold drink from the café and treat themselves to our delicious homemade delights.     These relaxed crafternoon sessions are free, open to everyone with no experience needed. You can either book or just turn up!     Perfect for curious kids, busy hands and anyone who loves making things, all in the cozy bookshop at the heart of the theatre.</p><!--]--> <!--[!--><!--]--></div> <div class=\"overflow-hidden self-end size-10 rounded-full bg-surface\"><button class=\"btn w-full h-full bg-primary/20 text-primary-darker dark:text-primary-lighter\"><i><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"o-beyonk-svg-icon o-beyonk-svg-icon-arrow-right\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M12.293 5.293a1 1 0 0 1 1.414 0l6 6a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.414l-6 6a1 1 0 0 1-1.414-1.414L16.586 13H5a1 1 0 1 1 0-2h11.586l-4.293-4.293a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.414\"></path></svg><!----></i></button></div></div></div></a><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></div><!----><!--]--><!----></div></div><!----><!--]--><!----></main> <footer class=\"flex flex-col items-center py-3 gap-5 svelte-1yfzzz9\"><ul class=\"flex text-sm leading-none text-primary-darker dark:text-primary-lightest empty:hidden svelte-1yfzzz9\"><!--[--><li class=\"px-4 font-medium svelte-1yfzzz9\"><a href=\"/2wopiy2m/about\" class=\"hover:text-primary-darkest dark:hover:text-primary-lighter hover:underline\">About us</a></li><li class=\"px-4 font-medium svelte-1yfzzz9\"><a href=\"/2wopiy2m/about#booking-policy\" class=\"hover:text-primary-darkest dark:hover:text-primary-lighter hover:underline\">Booking policy</a></li><li class=\"px-4 font-medium svelte-1yfzzz9\"><a href=\"/2wopiy2m/about#cancellations\" class=\"hover:text-primary-darkest dark:hover:text-primary-lighter hover:underline\">Cancellations</a></li><!--]--></ul> <p class=\"svelte-knip0o\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 22 20\" aria-label=\"Beyonk logo\"><path d=\"M0 0C0.134952 0.695578 0.33781 1.38012 0.608574 2.04251C1.6882 4.59564 3.84745 6.62053 6.45655 7.58896C7.89605 8.1172 9.42554 8.38131 10.9663 8.38131C12.507 8.38131 14.0589 8.1172 15.5434 7.58896C16.893 7.06073 18.1525 6.35642 19.1422 5.38799C20.1319 4.41956 20.9416 3.27505 21.3914 2.04251C21.6622 1.38012 21.865 0.695578 22 0H16.3091C16.2942 0.0353214 16.2789 0.0705389 16.2632 0.105647C15.9933 0.809959 15.5434 1.33819 15.0036 1.86643C13.2942 3.36309 10.955 3.80328 8.79576 3.01093C7.44622 2.4827 6.3666 1.42623 5.73681 0.0176092C5.73425 0.0117474 5.73169 0.00587769 5.72914 6.16348e-09L0 0Z\" fill=\"#32B0A2\"></path><path d=\"M5.72914 20H0C0.134952 19.3044 0.33781 18.6199 0.608574 17.9575C1.6882 15.4044 3.84745 13.3795 6.45655 12.411C7.89605 11.8828 9.42553 11.6187 10.9663 11.6187C12.507 11.6187 14.0589 11.8828 15.5434 12.411C16.893 12.9393 18.1525 13.6436 19.1422 14.612C20.1319 15.5804 20.9416 16.7249 21.3914 17.9575C21.6622 18.6199 21.865 19.3044 22 20H16.3091C16.2942 19.9647 16.2789 19.9295 16.2632 19.8944C15.9933 19.19 15.5434 18.6618 15.0036 18.1336C13.2942 16.6369 10.955 16.1967 8.79576 16.9891C7.44622 17.5173 6.3666 18.5738 5.73681 19.9824C5.73425 19.9883 5.73169 19.9941 5.72914 20Z\" fill=\"#32B0A2\"></path></svg><!----> <a href=\"https://beyonk.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Sell tickets online with Beyonk</a></p><!----></footer></div><!----><!--]--><!----><!----><!--]--> <!--[!--><!--]--><!--]-->\n\t\t\t<script type=\"application/json\" data-sveltekit-fetched data-url=\"https://api.beyonk.com/api/v1/buy/organisation/2wopiy2m\" data-hash=\"1evawbo\" data-ttl=\"15\">{\"status\":200,\"statusText\":\"OK\",\"headers\":{},\"body\":\"{\\\"id\\\":\\\"2wopiy2m\\\",\\\"contactEmail\\\":\\\"hello@thewellwalktheatre.com\\\",\\\"phone\\\":\\\"02039511465\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Welcome to our family theatre in Hampstead Village, where every visit is an adventure! Delight in captivating shows for all ages, browse through our enchanting children's books, and enjoy our home-made french food in our parisian style cafe. \\\\\\\"Come à La Maison\\\\\\\"\\\",\\\"bookingPolicy\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"link\\\",\\\"details\\\":\\\"https://www.thewellwalktheatre.com/\\\"},\\\"cancellationPolicy\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"custom\\\",\\\"details\\\":\\\"\\u003C!-- converted from markdown -->\\\\nAll tickets are non-refundable. Tickets may be transferred to another show up to 48 hours before the start time of the booked performance. After this we will be unable to transfer your tickets under any circumstance. Please contact us if you need assistance.\\u003Cbr />hello@thewellwalktheatre.com\\u003Cbr /> 020 3951 1465\\\"},\\\"bookingFee\\\":{\\\"rate\\\":0.05,\\\"cap\\\":null},\\\"resources\\\":[],\\\"currency\\\":\\\"gbp\\\",\\\"tracking\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"meta\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"2427021604410555\\\"}],\\\"companyName\\\":\\\"The Well Walk Theatre\\\",\\\"experiments\\\":{},\\\"subscriptions\\\":{\\\"marketing\\\":{\\\"enabled\\\":true,\\\"config\\\":{\\\"publishTestimonials\\\":true}}},\\\"region\\\":\\\"gb_gb\\\",\\\"logo\\\":{\\\"path\\\":\\\"avatars/image_cr35vryyof0ft7om.jpeg\\\",\\\"mimeType\\\":\\\"image/jpeg\\\"},\\\"primaryBrandColor\\\":\\\"#F2E0C4\\\",\\\"cashVouchersValidity\\\":{\\\"value\\\":1,\\\"unit\\\":\\\"year\\\"},\\\"flags\\\":{\\\"hasPassTerms\\\":false,\\\"hasQuestions\\\":true,\\\"hasEnquiries\\\":false,\\\"hasResources\\\":false,\\\"hasTracking\\\":true,\\\"chargesEnabled\\\":true,\\\"requiresEmailConfirmation\\\":false,\\\"usesSalesTax\\\":false,\\\"publishTestimonials\\\":true,\\\"cashVoucherLimit\\\":1500},\\\"productTypes\\\":{\\\"cashVouchers\\\":{\\\"enabled\\\":true,\\\"count\\\":1},\\\"experienceVouchers\\\":{\\\"enabled\\\":false,\\\"count\\\":0},\\\"memberships\\\":{\\\"enabled\\\":false,\\\"count\\\":0},\\\"passes\\\":{\\\"enabled\\\":false,\\\"count\\\":0},\\\"experiences\\\":{\\\"enabled\\\":true,\\\"count\\\":6}}}\"}</script>\n\t\t\t<script type=\"application/json\" data-sveltekit-fetched data-url=\"https://api.beyonk.com/api/v1/buy/organisation/2wopiy2m/experience-groups/experiences?\" data-hash=\"1evawbo\" data-ttl=\"15\">{\"status\":200,\"statusText\":\"OK\",\"headers\":{},\"body\":\"{\\\"id\\\":\\\"experiences\\\",\\\"parent\\\":null,\\\"items\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"dq2c4q4a\\\",\\\"parent\\\":\\\"experiences\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"experience\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"The Lady of Well Walk - (Every Thursday July & August) For curious minds from 12 to 112 years\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"\\u003Cdiv>\\u003Cb>23rd July - 27th August 2026\\u003C/b>\\u003C/div>\\u003Cb>An Afternoon with the Lady of Well Walk\\u003C/b>\\u003Cdiv>\\u003Cdiv>Step quietly into the Victorian salon of the Lady of Well Walk, where the ghost of a celebrated actress still receives her guests.Through an intimate and immersive reading of works by Hampstead's great writers, she invites you on a journey into another age, followed by an elegant Afternoon Tea at our Parisian Café.\\u003C/div>\\u003Cdiv>\\u003Cbr />\\u003C/div>\\u003Cdiv>\\u003Cdiv>\\u003Cul>\\u003Cli>\\u003Ci>The immersive reading runs for 35 minutes. Guests who have also booked Afternoon Tea will then be served at our café for a further 60 minutes. \\u003C/i>\\u003C/li>\\u003C/ul>\\u003C/div>\\u003C/div>\\u003Cul>\\u003Cli>\\u003Ci>To view August dates, click the top-right arrow in the calendar after \\\\\\\"Choose Availability\\\\\\\".\\u003C/i>\\u003C/li>\\u003C/ul>\\u003Chr />\\u003Cb>Afternoon Tea Menu \\u003C/b>\\u003C/div>\\u003Cdiv>\\u003Ci>*Please note Champagne is not included. You can upgrade to a glass of Champagne from £17.00 at the venue, just speak to a member of our team.\\u003C/i>\\u003C/div>\\u003Cdiv>\\u003Ci>\\u003Cbr />\\u003C/i>\\u003C/div>\\u003Cdiv>SALÉ \\u003C/div>\\u003Cdiv>\\u003Cul>\\u003Cli>Cucumber &amp; tuna sandwich \\u003C/li>\\u003C/ul>\\u003Cdiv>\\u003Cul>\\u003Cli>Rillettes &amp; cornichon sandwich \\u003C/li>\\u003C/ul>\\u003Cdiv>\\u003Cul>\\u003Cli>Ham &amp; Comté cheese sandwich \\u003C/li>\\u003C/ul>\\u003Cdiv>\\u003Cul>\\u003Cli>Vegetarian quiches\\u003C/li>\\u003C/ul>\\u003Cdiv>SUCRÉ \\u003Cbr />\\u003Cdiv>\\u003Cul>\\u003Cli>Fruit tartelettes\\u003C/li>\\u003C/ul>\\u003Cdiv>\\u003Cdiv>\\u003Cul>\\u003Cli>Chocolate fondant\\u003C/li>\\u003C/ul>\\u003Cdiv>\\u003Cul>\\u003Cli>Crème brûlée \\u003C/li>\\u003C/ul>\\u003Cdiv>\\u003Cul>\\u003Cli>Macaron\\u003C/li>\\u003C/ul>\\u003Cdiv>\\u003Cul>\\u003Cli>Traditional scones with clotted cream &amp; jam\\u003C/li>\\u003C/ul>\\u003Cdiv>\\u003Chr />\\u003C/div>\\u003C/div>\\u003C/div>\\u003C/div>\\u003C/div>\\u003C/div>\\u003C/div>\\u003C/div>\\u003C/div>\\u003C/div>\\u003C/div>\\u003C/div>\\u003Cdiv>\\u003Cul>\\u003Cli>\\u003Ci>For any allergies or dietary requirements, please email hello@thewellwalktheatre.com before booking. Afternoon Tea price includes a 12.5% service charge.\\u003Cbr />\\u003C/i>\\u003C/li>\\u003Cli>\\u003Ci>Children under 18 months are welcome to join without a ticket. However, due to capacity limitations, they may need to sit on a parent or carer's lap.\\u003Cbr />\\u003C/i>\\u003C/li>\\u003Cli>\\u003Ci>A ticket-carrying adult must accompany all children under 15 throughout the performance, with a minimum ratio of 1 adult per 6 children.\\u003C/i>\\u003Cbr />\\u003C/li>\\u003C/ul>\\u003C/div>\\\",\\\"media\\\":[{\\\"path\\\":\\\"experiences/image_6vj3xhadxz02d6120xpp3e01433oa6n4.jpg\\\",\\\"mimeType\\\":\\\"image/jpeg\\\"}],\\\"published\\\":true,\\\"position\\\":2,\\\"standalone\\\":true},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"3z5kd5yx\\\",\\\"parent\\\":\\\"experiences\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"experience\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"The Playhouse Buster Keaton Cineclub [Duration 23mins] For curious minds from 6 to 116 years\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"\\u003Cdiv>\\u003Cb>22nd - 30th August 2026\\u003C/b>\\u003C/div>\\u003Cdiv>\\u003Cb>\\u003Cbr />\\u003C/b>\\u003C/div>\\u003Cdiv>\\u003Cdiv>This summer, step inside The Well Walk Theatre to enjoy the early films that shaped the history of cinema.\\u003C/div>\\u003Cdiv>\\u003Cbr />\\u003C/div>\\u003Cdiv>Step into the mind-bending world of the legendary Buster Keaton in his 1921 masterpiece, \\u003Cb>The Playhouse\\u003C/b>. Before green screens and digital effects, Buster Keaton pushed the absolute limits of optical film trickery to do the impossible: portraying more than twenty characters \\u003Ci>at the exact same time\\u003C/i>. Don’t miss this breathtaking, hilarious tribute to the golden age of physical comedy. It’s a wild, nostalgic ride that proves classic film effects really \\u003Ci>were\\u003C/i> special.\\u003C/div>\\u003Cdiv>\\u003Cbr />\\u003C/div>\\u003Cdiv>Film Duration: 23mins\\u003C/div>\\u003Cdiv>\\u003Cbr />\\u003C/div>\\u003Cdiv>\\u003Cbr />\\u003C/div>\\u003Cdiv>\\u003Cul>\\u003Cli>\\u003Ci>Recommended age: 6yrs to 116yrs\\u003C/i>\\u003C/li>\\u003Cli>\\u003Ci>Children under 18 months are welcome to join without a ticket. However, due to capacity limitations, they may need to sit on a parent or carer's lap.\\u003Cbr />\\u003C/i>\\u003C/li>\\u003C/ul>\\u003Cdiv>\\u003Cul>\\u003Cli>\\u003Ci>A ticket-carrying adult must accompany all children under 15 throughout the performance, with a minimum ratio of 1 adult per 6 children.\\u003C/i>\\u003C/li>\\u003C/ul>\\u003C/div>\\u003C/div>\\u003Cdiv>\\u003Cbr />\\u003C/div>\\u003Cdiv>\\u003Cbr />\\u003C/div>\\u003C/div>\\\",\\\"media\\\":[{\\\"path\\\":\\\"experiences/image_hxjz2pu9wef1cv9i6krdi2mxekl3owgl.jpg\\\",\\\"mimeType\\\":\\\"image/jpeg\\\"}],\\\"published\\\":true,\\\"position\\\":3,\\\"standalone\\\":true},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"xlbf\\\",\\\"parent\\\":\\\"experiences\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"group\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Children's Readings\\\",\\\"media\\\":[{\\\"path\\\":\\\"experience-groups/image_smiacc9pvcla3s4mx7fxffhd07pxd1f7.jpeg\\\",\\\"mimeType\\\":\\\"image/jpeg\\\"}],\\\"position\\\":4,\\\"experiencesCount\\\":2},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"gpwcwrz8\\\",\\\"parent\\\":\\\"experiences\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"experience\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Petit Pierre From Transylvania (Ages 3 to 103) November\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"\\u003Cdiv>Saturday 10th - Sunday 1st November\\u003C/div>\\u003Cdiv>11am,  3pm\\u003C/div>\\u003Cdiv>\\u003Cbr />\\u003C/div>Join Petit Pierre and his loyal sidekick Gedeon on a thrilling journey to the misty mountains of Transylvania! When a mysterious customer places an unusual order, the duo embarks on an adventure packed with surprising twists, spooky encounters, and plenty of laughs. This delightful puppet show for all ages will add a touch of magic and fun to your Halloween season.\\u003Cbr />\\u003Cbr />\\u003Cdiv>\\u003Cul>\\u003Cli>Children under 18month can come without a ticket but might have to sit on their parent or carer's lap.\\u003C/li>\\u003C/ul>\\u003C/div>\\u003Cdiv>\\u003Cul>\\u003Cli>Children under 15 have to be accompanied by an adult throughout the performance.\\u003C/li>\\u003C/ul>\\u003C/div>\\\",\\\"media\\\":[{\\\"path\\\":\\\"experiences/image_ykwfqvu8sjr1lo0im01k1njaxzpikxtc.jpg\\\",\\\"mimeType\\\":\\\"image/jpeg\\\"}],\\\"published\\\":true,\\\"position\\\":5,\\\"standalone\\\":true},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"ob5fifhm\\\",\\\"parent\\\":\\\"experiences\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"experience\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Crafternoon\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"\\u003Cdiv>Every Friday\\u003C/div>\\u003Cdiv>\\u003Cdiv>\\u003Cul>\\u003Cli>3.30 pm to 4.30pm\\u003C/li>\\u003C/ul>\\u003Cdiv>\\u003Cbr />\\u003C/div>\\u003C/div>\\u003Cdiv>Our Much loved Crafternoon's return! We have moved this special free event to Fridays, so why don't you come down and learn how to create some wonders!\\u003C/div>\\u003Cdiv>\\u003Cbr />\\u003C/div>\\u003Cdiv>After school, the theatre’s bookshop will transform into a creative space where one of our team members will lead mystery craft activities. Meanwhile, parents are warmly invited to relax with a hot or cold drink from the café and treat themselves to our delicious homemade delights.\\u003C/div>\\u003Cdiv>\\u003Cbr />\\u003C/div>\\u003Cdiv>These relaxed crafternoon sessions are free, open to everyone with no experience needed. You can either book or just turn up!\\u003C/div>\\u003Cdiv>\\u003Cbr />\\u003C/div>\\u003Cdiv>Perfect for curious kids, busy hands and anyone who loves making things, all in the cozy bookshop at the heart of the theatre.\\u003C/div>\\u003C/div>\\\",\\\"media\\\":[{\\\"path\\\":\\\"experiences/image_b4eegxkb4uky5r0u0kly0rqu79d3o97u.jpg\\\",\\\"mimeType\\\":\\\"image/jpeg\\\"}],\\\"published\\\":true,\\\"position\\\":6,\\\"standalone\\\":true}],\\\"experiencesCount\\\":6}\"}</script>\n\t\t\t<script>\n\t\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\t\t__sveltekit_1xyzh7 = {\n\t\t\t\t\t\tbase: new URL(\"..\", location).pathname.slice(0, -1)\n\t\t\t\t\t};\n\n\t\t\t\t\tconst element = document.currentScript.parentElement;\n\n\t\t\t\t\tPromise.all([\n\t\t\t\t\t\timport(\"../_app/immutable/entry/start.BfeOz4Pn.js\"),\n\t\t\t\t\t\timport(\"../_app/immutable/entry/app.CD8eGA0Y.js\")\n\t\t\t\t\t]).then(([kit, app]) => {\n\t\t\t\t\t\tkit.start(app, element, {\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tnode_ids: [0, 2, 6, 18],\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata: [{type:\"data\",data:{session:{cartId:void 0},locale:\"en\",integration:{organisation:\"2wopiy2m\",tags:[],id:\"byk-light\",tabs:true,theme:{background:\"#ffffff\",text:\"#232323\",primary:\"#F2E0C4\"}},shopfront:\"https://shop.beyonk.com/2wopiy2m/experiences\",cfg:{attribution:{source:\"portal\"},size:{maximumWidth:\"unset\",maximumHeight:\"unset\"}}},uses:{}},null,null,null],\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tform: null,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\terror: null\n\t\t\t\t\t\t});\n\t\t\t\t\t});\n\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t</script>\n\t\t</div>\n  </body>\n</html>\n",
