l=\"15\">{\"status\":200,\"statusText\":\"OK\",\"headers\":{},\"body\":\"{\\\"id\\\":\\\"2wopiy2m\\\",\\\"contactEmail\\\":\\\"hello@thewellwalktheatre.com\\\",\\\"phone\\\":\\\"02039511465\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Welcome to our family theatre in Hampstead Village, where every visit is an adventure! Delight in captivating shows for all ages, browse through our enchanting children's books, and enjoy our home-made french food in our parisian style cafe. \\\\\\\"Come à La Maison\\\\\\\"\\\",\\\"bookingPolicy\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"link\\\",\\\"details\\\":\\\"https://www.thewellwalktheatre.com/\\\"},\\\"cancellationPolicy\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"custom\\\",\\\"details\\\":\\\"\\u003C!-- converted from markdown -->\\\\nAll tickets are non-refundable. Tickets may be transferred to another show up to 48 hours before the start time of the booked performance. After this we will be unable to transfer your tickets under any circumstance. Please contact us if you need assistance.\\u003Cbr />hello@thewellwalktheatre.com\\u003Cbr /> 020 3951 1465\\\"},\\\"bookingFee\\\":{\\\"rate\\\":0.05,\\\"cap\\\":null},\\\"resources\\\":[],\\\"currency\\\":\\\"gbp\\\",\\\"tracking\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"meta\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"2427021604410555\\\"}],\\\"companyName\\\":\\\"The Well Walk Theatre\\\",\\\"experiments\\\":{},\\\"subscriptions\\\":{\\\"marketing\\\":{\\\"enabled\\\":true,\\\"config\\\":{\\\"publishTestimonials\\\":true}}},\\\"region\\\":\\\"gb_gb\\\",\\\"logo\\\":{\\\"path\\\":\\\"avatars/image_cr35vryyof0ft7om.jpeg\\\",\\\"mimeType\\\":\\\"image/jpeg\\\"},\\\"primaryBrandColor\\\":\\\"#F2E0C4\\\",\\\"cashVouchersValidity\\\":{\\\"value\\\":1,\\\"unit\\\":\\\"year\\\"},\\\"flags\\\":{\\\"hasPassTerms\\\":false,\\\"hasQuestions\\\":true,\\\"hasEnquiries\\\":false,\\\"hasResources\\\":false,\\\"hasTracking\\\":true,\\\"chargesEnabled\\\":true,\\\"requiresEmailConfirmation\\\":false,\\\"usesSalesTax\\\":false,\\\"publishTestimonials\\\":true,\\\"cashVoucherLimit\\\":1500},\\\"productTypes\\\":{\\\"cashVouchers\\\":{\\\"enabled\\\":true,\\\"count\\\":1},\\\"experienceVouchers\\\":{\\\"enabled\\\":false,\\\"count\\\":0},\\\"memberships\\\":{\\\"enabled\\\":false,\\\"count\\\":0},\\\"passes\\\":{\\\"enabled\\\":false,\\\"count\\\":0},\\\"experiences\\\":{\\\"enabled\\\":true,\\\"count\\\":6}}}\"}</script>\n\t\t\t<script type=\"application/json\" data-sveltekit-fetched data-url=\"https://api.beyonk.com/api/v1/buy/experience/dq2c4q4a?source=portal\" data-hash=\"1evawbo\" data-ttl=\"15\">{\"status\":200,\"statusText\":\"OK\",\"headers\":{},\"body\":\"{\\\"id\\\":\\\"dq2c4q4a\\\",\\\"organisation\\\":\\\"2wopiy2m\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"The Lady of Well Walk - (Every Thursday July & August) For curious minds from 12 to 112 years\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"\\u003Cdiv>\\u003Cb>23rd July - 27th August 2026\\u003C/b>\\u003C/div>\\u003Cb>An Afternoon with the Lady of Well Walk\\u003C/b>\\u003Cdiv>\\u003Cdiv>Step quietly into the Victorian salon of the Lady of Well Walk, where the ghost of a celebrated actress still receives her guests.Through an intimate and immersive reading of works by Hampstead's great writers, she invites you on a journey into another age, followed by an elegant Afternoon Tea at our Parisian Café.\\u003C/div>\\u003Cdiv>\\u003Cbr />\\u003C/div>\\u003Cdiv>\\u003Cdiv>\\u003Cul>\\u003Cli>\\u003Ci>The immersive reading runs for 35 minutes. Guests who have also booked Afternoon Tea will then be served at our café for a further 60 minutes. \\u003C/i>\\u003C/li>\\u003C/ul>\\u003C/div>\\u003C/div>\\u003Cul>\\u003Cli>\\u003Ci>To view August dates, click the top-right arrow in the calendar after \\\\\\\"Choose Availability\\\\\\\".\\u003C/i>\\u003C/li>\\u003C/ul>\\u003Chr />\\u003Cb>Afternoon Tea Menu \\u003C/b>\\u003C/div>\\u003Cdiv>\\u003Ci>*Please note Champagne is not included. You can upgrade to a glass of Champagne from £17.00 at the venue, just speak to a member of our team.\\u003C/i>\\u003C/div>\\u003Cdiv>\\u003Ci>\\u003Cbr />\\u003C/i>\\u003C/div>\\u003Cdiv>SALÉ \\u003C/div>\\u003Cdiv>\\u003Cul>\\u003Cli>Cucumber &amp; tuna sandwich \\u003C/li>\\u003C/ul>\\u003Cdiv>\\u003Cul>\\u003Cli>Rillettes &amp; cornichon sandwich \\u003C/li>\\u003C/ul>\\u003Cdiv>\\u003Cul>\\u003Cli>Ham &amp; Comté cheese sandwich \\u003C/li>\\u003C/ul>\\u003Cdiv>\\u003Cul>\\u003Cli>Vegetarian quiches\\u003C/li>\\u003C/ul>\\u003Cdiv>SUCRÉ \\u003Cbr />\\u003Cdiv>\\u003Cul>\\u003Cli>Fruit tartelettes\\u003C/li>\\u003C/ul>\\u003Cdiv>\\u003Cdiv>\\u003Cul>\\u003Cli>Chocolate fondant\\u003C/li>\\u003C/ul>\\u003Cdiv>\\u003Cul>\\u003Cli>Crème brûlée \\u003C/li>\\u003C/ul>\\u003Cdiv>\\u003Cul>\\u003Cli>Macaron\\u003C/li>\\u003C/ul>\\u003Cdiv>\\u003Cul>\\u003Cli>Traditional scones with clotted cream &amp; jam\\u003C/li>\\u003C/ul>\\u003Cdiv>\\u003Chr />\\u003C/div>\\u003C/div>\\u003C/div>\\u003C/div>\\u003C/div>\\u003C/div>\\u003C/div>\\u003C/div>\\u003C/div>\\u003C/div>\\u003C/div>\\u003C/div>\\u003Cdiv>\\u003Cul>\\u003Cli>\\u003Ci>For any allergies or dietary requirements, please email hello@thewellwalktheatre.com before booking. Afternoon Tea price includes a 12.5% service charge.\\u003Cbr />\\u003C/i>\\u003C/li>\\u003Cli>\\u003Ci>Children under 18 months are welcome to join without a ticket. However, due to capacity limitations, they may need to sit on a parent or carer's lap.\\u003Cbr />\\u003C/i>\\u003C/li>\\u003Cli>\\u003Ci>A ticket-carrying adult must accompany all children under 15 throughout the performance, with a minimum ratio of 1 adult per 6 children.\\u003C/i>\\u003Cbr />\\u003C/li>\\u003C/ul>\\u003C/div>\\\",\\\"pricing\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"standard\\\",\\\"currency\\\":\\\"gbp\\\",\\\"tickets\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"tk_wfv4hxmv\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Immersive Reading (35min) - Including Afternoon Tea (60min)\\\",\\\"price\\\":60.6,\\\"resources\\\":[],\\\"attendees\\\":1,\\\"limit\\\":0,\\\"bookingFee\\\":3.64,\\\"displayPrice\\\":64.24},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Immersive Reading (35min) - Excluding Afternoon Tea\\\",\\\"price\\\":10,\\\"attendees\\\":1,\\\"limit\\\":null,\\\"resources\\\":[],\\\"id\\\":\\\"tk_1th98pdv\\\",\\\"bookingFee\\\":0.6,\\\"displayPrice\\\":10.6}],\\\"dependencies\\\":[],\\\"discounts\\\":[],\\\"addons\\\":[]},\\\"bookingProtectionAddonId\\\":null,\\\"location\\\":{\\\"timezone\\\":\\\"Europe/London\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"NW3 1TS, Londres, Gran Londres, Inglaterra, Reino Unido\\\",\\\"point\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"Point\\\",\\\"coordinates\\\":[-0.174295,51.557573],\\\"zoom\\\":7}},\\\"capacity\\\":{\\\"maxBookingsPerTimeslot\\\":null,\\\"minAttendeesPerBooking\\\":1,\\\"maxAttendeesPerBooking\\\":null,\\\"maxAttendeesPerTimeslot\\\":40,\\\"availabilityIndicators\\\":{\\\"enabled\\\":false,\\\"threshold\\\":75}},\\\"media\\\":[{\\\"path\\\":\\\"experiences/image_6vj3xhadxz02d6120xpp3e01433oa6n4.jpg\\\",\\\"mimeType\\\":\\\"image/jpeg\\\"}],\\\"arrivalWindow\\\":null,\\\"flags\\\":{\\\"firstAvailableOccurrence\\\":\\\"2026-08-27T14:30--PT35M\\\",\\\"nearestScheduledOccurrence\\\":\\\"2026-08-27T14:30--PT35M\\\",\\\"hasInstantBook\\\":true,\\\"hasExclusiveBookings\\\":false,\\\"hasDiscounts\\\":false,\\\"hasVariablePricing\\\":false,\\\"promotesPriceVariations\\\":true,\\\"hasRecurringSchedule\\\":true,\\\"hasSlotBasedSchedule\\\":false,\\\"isOneOffEvent\\\":false,\\\"hasAddonsAvailable\\\":false,\\\"hasBookingProtection\\\":false,\\\"selfServe\\\":{\\\"cutoff\\\":null,\\\"canCancel\\\":null,\\\"canReschedule\\\":null},\\\"bookingCutoff\\\":{\\\"duration\\\":{\\\"value\\\":0,\\\"unit\\\":\\\"minutes\\\"},\\\"before\\\":\\\"start\\\"}}}\"}</script>\n\t\t\t<script>\n\t\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\t\t__sveltekit_1v6lki1 = {\n\t\t\t\t\t\tbase: new URL(\"../../../..\", location).pathname.slice(0, -1)\n\t\t\t\t\t};\n\n\t\t\t\t\tconst element = document.currentScript.parentElement;\n\n\t\t\t\t\tPromise.all([\n\t\t\t\t\t\timport(\"../../../../_app/immutable/entry/start.CWz4_J8E.js\"),\n\t\t\t\t\t\timport(\"../../../../_app/immutable/entry/app.Cx8hUNJg.js\")\n\t\t\t\t\t]).then(([kit, app]) 