cy\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"custom\\\",\\\"details\\\":\\\"\\u003C!-- converted from markdown -->\\\\nAll tickets are non-refundable. Tickets may be transferred to another show up to 48 hours before the start time of the booked performance. After this we will be unable to transfer your tickets under any circumstance. Please contact us if you need assistance.\\u003Cbr />hello@thewellwalktheatre.com\\u003Cbr /> 020 3951 1465\\\"},\\\"bookingFee\\\":{\\\"rate\\\":0.05,\\\"cap\\\":null},\\\"resources\\\":[],\\\"currency\\\":\\\"gbp\\\",\\\"tracking\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"meta\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"2427021604410555\\\"}],\\\"companyName\\\":\\\"The Well Walk Theatre\\\",\\\"experiments\\\":{},\\\"subscriptions\\\":{\\\"marketing\\\":{\\\"enabled\\\":true,\\\"config\\\":{\\\"publishTestimonials\\\":true}}},\\\"region\\\":\\\"gb_gb\\\",\\\"logo\\\":{\\\"path\\\":\\\"avatars/image_cr35vryyof0ft7om.jpeg\\\",\\\"mimeType\\\":\\\"image/jpeg\\\"},\\\"primaryBrandColor\\\":\\\"#F2E0C4\\\",\\\"cashVouchersValidity\\\":{\\\"value\\\":1,\\\"unit\\\":\\\"year\\\"},\\\"flags\\\":{\\\"hasPassTerms\\\":false,\\\"hasQuestions\\\":true,\\\"hasEnquiries\\\":false,\\\"hasResources\\\":false,\\\"hasTracking\\\":true,\\\"chargesEnabled\\\":true,\\\"requiresEmailConfirmation\\\":false,\\\"usesSalesTax\\\":false,\\\"publishTestimonials\\\":true,\\\"cashVoucherLimit\\\":1500},\\\"productTypes\\\":{\\\"cashVouchers\\\":{\\\"enabled\\\":true,\\\"count\\\":1},\\\"experienceVouchers\\\":{\\\"enabled\\\":false,\\\"count\\\":0},\\\"memberships\\\":{\\\"enabled\\\":false,\\\"count\\\":0},\\\"passes\\\":{\\\"enabled\\\":false,\\\"count\\\":0},\\\"experiences\\\":{\\\"enabled\\\":true,\\\"count\\\":6}}}\"}</script>\n\t\t\t<script type=\"application/json\" data-sveltekit-fetched data-url=\"https://api.beyonk.com/api/v1/buy/experience/3z5kd5yx?source=portal\" data-hash=\"1evawbo\" data-ttl=\"15\">{\"status\":200,\"statusText\":\"OK\",\"headers\":{},\"body\":\"{\\\"id\\\":\\\"3z5kd5yx\\\",\\\"organisation\\\":\\\"2wopiy2m\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"The Playhouse Buster Keaton Cineclub [Duration 23mins] For curious minds from 6 to 116 years\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"\\u003Cdiv>\\u003Cb>22nd - 30th August 2026\\u003C/b>\\u003C/div>\\u003Cdiv>\\u003Cb>\\u003Cbr />\\u003C/b>\\u003C/div>\\u003Cdiv>\\u003Cdiv>This summer, step inside The Well Walk Theatre to enjoy the early films that shaped the history of cinema.\\u003C/div>\\u003Cdiv>\\u003Cbr />\\u003C/div>\\u003Cdiv>Step into the mind-bending world of the legendary Buster Keaton in his 1921 masterpiece, \\u003Cb>The Playhouse\\u003C/b>. Before green screens and digital effects, Buster Keaton pushed the absolute limits of optical film trickery to do the impossible: portraying more than twenty characters \\u003Ci>at the exact same time\\u003C/i>. Don’t miss this breathtaking, hilarious tribute to the golden age of physical comedy. It’s a wild, nostalgic ride that proves classic film effects really \\u003Ci>were\\u003C/i> special.\\u003C/div>\\u003Cdiv>\\u003Cbr />\\u003C/div>\\u003Cdiv>Film Duration: 23mins\\u003C/div>\\u003Cdiv>\\u003Cbr />\\u003C/div>\\u003Cdiv>\\u003Cbr />\\u003C/div>\\u003Cdiv>\\u003Cul>\\u003Cli>\\u003Ci>Recommended age: 6yrs to 116yrs\\u003C/i>\\u003C/li>\\u003Cli>\\u003Ci>Children under 18 months are welcome to join without a ticket. However, due to capacity limitations, they may need to sit on a parent or carer's lap.\\u003Cbr />\\u003C/i>\\u003C/li>\\u003C/ul>\\u003Cdiv>\\u003Cul>\\u003Cli>\\u003Ci>A ticket-carrying adult must accompany all children under 15 throughout the performance, with a minimum ratio of 1 adult per 6 children.\\u003C/i>\\u003C/li>\\u003C/ul>\\u003C/div>\\u003C/div>\\u003Cdiv>\\u003Cbr />\\u003C/div>\\u003Cdiv>\\u003Cbr />\\u003C/div>\\u003C/div>\\\",\\\"pricing\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"standard\\\",\\\"currency\\\":\\\"gbp\\\",\\\"tickets\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"tk_3mh1jg6s\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Standard Admission\\\",\\\"price\\\":10,\\\"resources\\\":[],\\\"attendees\\\":1,\\\"limit\\\