",\\\"contactEmail\\\":\\\"hello@thewellwalktheatre.com\\\",\\\"phone\\\":\\\"02039511465\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Welcome to our family theatre in Hampstead Village, where every visit is an adventure! Delight in captivating shows for all ages, browse through our enchanting children's books, and enjoy our home-made french food in our parisian style cafe. \\\\\\\"Come à La Maison\\\\\\\"\\\",\\\"bookingPolicy\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"link\\\",\\\"details\\\":\\\"https://www.thewellwalktheatre.com/\\\"},\\\"cancellationPolicy\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"custom\\\",\\\"details\\\":\\\"\\u003C!-- converted from markdown -->\\\\nAll tickets are non-refundable. Tickets may be transferred to another show up to 48 hours before the start time of the booked performance. After this we will be unable to transfer your tickets under any circumstance. Please contact us if you need assistance.\\u003Cbr />hello@thewellwalktheatre.com\\u003Cbr /> 020 3951 1465\\\"},\\\"bookingFee\\\":{\\\"rate\\\":0.05,\\\"cap\\\":null},\\\"resources\\\":[],\\\"currency\\\":\\\"gbp\\\",\\\"tracking\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"meta\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"2427021604410555\\\"}],\\\"companyName\\\":\\\"The Well Walk Theatre\\\",\\\"experiments\\\":{},\\\"subscriptions\\\":{\\\"marketing\\\":{\\\"enabled\\\":true,\\\"config\\\":{\\\"publishTestimonials\\\":true}}},\\\"region\\\":\\\"gb_gb\\\",\\\"logo\\\":{\\\"path\\\":\\\"avatars/image_cr35vryyof0ft7om.jpeg\\\",\\\"mimeType\\\":\\\"image/jpeg\\\"},\\\"primaryBrandColor\\\":\\\"#F2E0C4\\\",\\\"cashVouchersValidity\\\":{\\\"value\\\":1,\\\"unit\\\":\\\"year\\\"},\\\"flags\\\":{\\\"hasPassTerms\\\":false,\\\"hasQuestions\\\":true,\\\"hasEnquiries\\\":false,\\\"hasResources\\\":false,\\\"hasTracking\\\":true,\\\"chargesEnabled\\\":true,\\\"requiresEmailConfirmation\\\":false,\\\"usesSalesTax\\\":false,\\\"publishTestimonials\\\":true,\\\"cashVoucherLimit\\\":1500},\\\"productTypes\\\":{\\\"cashVouchers\\\":{\\\"enabled\\\":true,\\\"count\\\":1},\\\"experienceVouchers\\\":{\\\"enabled\\\":false,\\\"count\\\":0},\\\"memberships\\\":{\\\"enabled\\\":false,\\\"count\\\":0},\\\"passes\\\":{\\\"enabled\\\":false,\\\"count\\\":0},\\\"experiences\\\":{\\\"enabled\\\":true,\\\"count\\\":6}}}\"}</script>\n\t\t\t<script type=\"application/json\" data-sveltekit-fetched data-url=\"https://api.beyonk.com/api/v1/buy/experience/gpwcwrz8?source=portal\" data-hash=\"1evawbo\" data-ttl=\"15\">{\"status\":200,\"statusText\":\"OK\",\"headers\":{},\"body\":\"{\\\"id\\\":\\\"gpwcwrz8\\\",\\\"organisation\\\":\\\"2wopiy2m\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Petit Pierre From Transylvania (Ages 3 to 103) November\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"\\u003Cdiv>Saturday 10th - Sunday 1st November\\u003C/div>\\u003Cdiv>11am,  3pm\\u003C/div>\\u003Cdiv>\\u003Cbr />\\u003C/div>Join Petit Pierre and his loyal sidekick Gedeon on a thrilling journey to the misty mountains of Transylvania! When a mysterious customer places an unusual order, the duo embarks on an adventure packed with surprising twists, spooky encounters, and plenty of laughs. This delightful puppet show for all ages will add a touch of magic and fun to your Halloween season.\\u003Cbr />\\u003Cbr />\\u003Cdiv>\\u003Cul>\\u003Cli>Children under 18month can come without a ticket but might have to sit on their parent or carer's lap.\\u003C/li>\\u003C/ul>\\u003C/div>\\u003Cdiv>\\u003Cul>\\u003Cli>Children under 15 have to be accompanied by an adult throughout the performance.\\u003C/li>\\u003C/ul>\\u003C/div>\\\",\\\"pricing\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"standard\\\",\\\"currency\\\":\\\"gbp\\\",\\\"tickets\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"tk_i3uz7891\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Adult\\\",\\\"price\\\":15,\\\"resources\\\":[],\\\"attendees\\\":1,\\\"limit\\\":null,\\\"bookingFee\\\":0.9,\\\"displayPrice\\\":15.9},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Child\\\",\\\"price\\\":15,\\\"attendees\\\":1,\\\"limit\\\":null,\\\"resources\\\":[],\\\"id\\\":\\\"tk_iuruddky\\\",\\\"bookingFee\\\":0.9,\\\"displayPrice\\\":15.9}],\\\"dependencies\\\":[{\\\"dependent\\\":{\\\"max\\\":6