e start time of the booked performance. After this we will be unable to transfer your tickets under any circumstance. Please contact us if you need assistance.\\u003Cbr />hello@thewellwalktheatre.com\\u003Cbr /> 020 3951 1465\\\"},\\\"bookingFee\\\":{\\\"rate\\\":0.05,\\\"cap\\\":null},\\\"resources\\\":[],\\\"currency\\\":\\\"gbp\\\",\\\"tracking\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"meta\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"2427021604410555\\\"}],\\\"companyName\\\":\\\"The Well Walk Theatre\\\",\\\"experiments\\\":{},\\\"subscriptions\\\":{\\\"marketing\\\":{\\\"enabled\\\":true,\\\"config\\\":{\\\"publishTestimonials\\\":true}}},\\\"region\\\":\\\"gb_gb\\\",\\\"logo\\\":{\\\"path\\\":\\\"avatars/image_cr35vryyof0ft7om.jpeg\\\",\\\"mimeType\\\":\\\"image/jpeg\\\"},\\\"primaryBrandColor\\\":\\\"#F2E0C4\\\",\\\"cashVouchersValidity\\\":{\\\"value\\\":1,\\\"unit\\\":\\\"year\\\"},\\\"flags\\\":{\\\"hasPassTerms\\\":false,\\\"hasQuestions\\\":true,\\\"hasEnquiries\\\":false,\\\"hasResources\\\":false,\\\"hasTracking\\\":true,\\\"chargesEnabled\\\":true,\\\"requiresEmailConfirmation\\\":false,\\\"usesSalesTax\\\":false,\\\"publishTestimonials\\\":true,\\\"cashVoucherLimit\\\":1500},\\\"productTypes\\\":{\\\"cashVouchers\\\":{\\\"enabled\\\":true,\\\"count\\\":1},\\\"experienceVouchers\\\":{\\\"enabled\\\":false,\\\"count\\\":0},\\\"memberships\\\":{\\\"enabled\\\":false,\\\"count\\\":0},\\\"passes\\\":{\\\"enabled\\\":false,\\\"count\\\":0},\\\"experiences\\\":{\\\"enabled\\\":true,\\\"count\\\":6}}}\"}</script>\n\t\t\t<script type=\"application/json\" data-sveltekit-fetched data-url=\"https://api.beyonk.com/api/v1/buy/experience/ob5fifhm?source=portal\" data-hash=\"1evawbo\" data-ttl=\"15\">{\"status\":200,\"statusText\":\"OK\",\"headers\":{},\"body\":\"{\\\"id\\\":\\\"ob5fifhm\\\",\\\"organisation\\\":\\\"2wopiy2m\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Crafternoon\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"\\u003Cdiv>Every Friday\\u003C/div>\\u003Cdiv>\\u003Cdiv>\\u003Cul>\\u003Cli>3.30 pm to 4.30pm\\u003C/li>\\u003C/ul>\\u003Cdiv>\\u003Cbr />\\u003C/div>\\u003C/div>\\u003Cdiv>Our Much loved Crafternoon's return! We have moved this special free event to Fridays, so why don't you come down and learn how to create some wonders!\\u003C/div>\\u003Cdiv>\\u003Cbr />\\u003C/div>\\u003Cdiv>After school, the theatre’s bookshop will transform into a creative space where one of our team members will lead mystery craft activities. Meanwhile, parents are warmly invited to relax with a hot or cold drink from the café and treat themselves to our delicious homemade delights.\\u003C/div>\\u003Cdiv>\\u003Cbr />\\u003C/div>\\u003Cdiv>These relaxed crafternoon sessions are free, open to everyone with no experience needed. You can either book or just turn up!\\u003C/div>\\u003Cdiv>\\u003Cbr />\\u003C/div>\\u003Cdiv>Perfect for curious kids, busy hands and anyone who loves making things, all in the cozy bookshop at the heart of the theatre.\\u003C/div>\\u003C/div>\\\",\\\"pricing\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"standard\\\",\\\"currency\\\":\\\"gbp\\\",\\\"tickets\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"tk_algykzcm\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Crafternoon Friday\\\",\\\"price\\\":0,\\\"resources\\\":[],\\\"attendees\\\":1,\\\"limit\\\":null,\\\"bookingFee\\\":0,\\\"displayPrice\\\":0}],\\\"dependencies\\\":[],\\\"discounts\\\":[],\\\"addons\\\":[]},\\\"bookingProtectionAddonId\\\":null,\\\"location\\\":{\\\"timezone\\\":\\\"Europe/London\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"49, Willow Road, London, England, NW3 1TS, United Kingdom\\\",\\\"point\\\":{\\\"coordinates\\\":[-0.17400080747592028,51.557012093821356],\\\"type\\\":\\\"Point\\\",\\\"zoom\\\":17}},\\\"capacity\\\":{\\\"maxBookingsPerTimeslot\\\":null,\\\"minAttendeesPerBooking\\\":1,\\\"maxAttendeesPerBooking\\\":null,\\\"maxAttendeesPerTimeslot\\\":10,\\\"availabilityIndicators\\\":{\\\"enabled\\\":false,\\\"threshold\\\":75}},\\\"media\\\":[{\\\"path\\\":\\\"experiences/image_b4eegxkb4uky5r0u0kly0rqu79d3o97u.jpg\\\",\\\"mimeType\\\":\\\"image/jpeg\\\"}],\\\"arrivalWindow\\\":null,\\\"flags\\\":{\\\"first